WEBVTT

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.130
That won't work.

00:00:12.460 --> 00:00:14.190
What just happened?

00:00:14.190 --> 00:00:17.150
What happened to your invincibility?

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:22.570
But I'm right here!

00:00:23.570 --> 00:00:26.040
This is the end for you, Bavarian Illuminati!

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:28.890
I'm in a bad mood right now.

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.200
If you try to resist, I won't 
be able to show any mercy.

00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.360
Little brats! I'll crush you underfoot!

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:27.870
<b>Episode 3
A Horoscope Drawn By Gears</b>

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:33.390
<i>Look up at the sun,</i>

00:02:33.390 --> 00:02:38.160
<i>Learn about many types of love,</i>

00:02:38.160 --> 00:02:42.860
<i>voices loud in the morning and evening,</i>

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:48.360
<i>live strong with the melody</i>

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:50.020
Summer Homework
Due at the Start of School on 9/1
NO EXCEPTIONS!

00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:52.580
<i>Even if you cry</i>

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:57.110
<i>At the end of a distant future</i>

00:02:57.110 --> 00:03:02.130
<i>Be proud with your chest held high, maiden</i>

00:03:02.130 --> 00:03:10.160
<i>Turning your dreams into song</i>

00:03:08.920 --> 00:03:10.900
It was really rough, huh?

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:13.760
I wondered where you'd gone.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:16.490
But that's what was happening on 
the other side of the world, huh?

00:03:16.490 --> 00:03:20.990
Yeah. I met more Alchemists there.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:25.260
Finé's remnants, the Symphogears.

00:03:25.260 --> 00:03:30.010
But that power cannot release 
humanity into the future.

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:31.910
They know Finé?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.140
And what does it mean to release humanity?

00:03:34.140 --> 00:03:36.510
They sound just like Ryoko-san.

00:03:36.510 --> 00:03:39.200
They want to release humanity 
from the Curse of Balal?

00:03:39.200 --> 00:03:41.910
Is that your goal?

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:44.360
Cagliostro. Prelati.

00:03:44.360 --> 00:03:45.570
We're retreating.

00:03:45.570 --> 00:03:48.130
We've lost Youaltepuztli, after all.

00:03:48.130 --> 00:03:50.400
We need to regroup.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:53.370
We've spent our time, and our lives,

00:03:53.370 --> 00:03:56.390
to return the future to human hands...

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.870
None can stop our advance.

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:02.000
Return the future to human hands?

00:04:02.420 --> 00:04:03.510
Wait!

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:11.130
If they're after the same 
thing as Ryoko-san...

00:04:11.130 --> 00:04:15.160
There may be a reason they have to do it.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:20.470
But that doesn't give them an 
excuse to hurt so many people!

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:25.740
Damn it all!

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.000
You shot his leg!

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:29.590
Yeah.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.260
I'm the one who pulled the trigger.

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:40.550
Hibiki, is there something 
else bothering you?

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:46.780
T-Tsubasa-san and Maria-san are 
staying there to investigate.

00:04:46.780 --> 00:04:51.780
They said they'd be back for the start 
of school, so they should be here, but...

00:04:55.860 --> 00:04:59.220
Hey, Miku... can I tell you something?

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:25.080
<i>Tiki is an Autoscorer, created to chart 
the movements of the planets</i>

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:26.810
<i>and the locations of the stars.</i>

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:31.340
<i>Even though she was put into 
stasis to preserve her secrets,</i>

00:05:31.790 --> 00:05:36.260
<i>this Antikythera Gear will reboot her,
 and she will awaken.</i>

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.170
It's been a long time, Tiki.

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:13.600
Saint Germain!

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:20.520
Even after about 400 years, 
you haven't changed at all!

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:24.560
Yes. Even though time has passed,
 nothing has changed.

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:29.430
So you're still doing all that gloomy 
stuff about releasing humanity

00:06:29.430 --> 00:06:32.350
from the bonds that control it?

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.400
I'm glad to see you're doing well.

00:06:34.770 --> 00:06:37.560
You haven't changed at all either, Tiki.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:42.220
By the way, where's Adam?

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:46.580
Without my beloved Adam, 
I can't remain myself!

00:06:57.680 --> 00:06:58.900
Director?

00:06:58.900 --> 00:07:02.240
What's that? Is it connected to Adam?

00:07:05.280 --> 00:07:07.150
Adam? Are you there?

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:10.200
<i>It's been so long since 
I've heard that voice!</i>

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:13.040
It is Adam! It's me!

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:15.690
Tiki, the girl who can do anything for you!

00:07:15.690 --> 00:07:18.530
<i>You're as boisterous as ever, huh?</i>

00:07:18.530 --> 00:07:21.680
<i>But why don't we talk more later?</i>

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:24.460
Aww, Adam, you're so cold!

00:07:24.460 --> 00:07:26.580
I love that about you, too, though.

00:07:29.790 --> 00:07:32.310
I'm sorry, Director.

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:35.990
Our experiment to realize 
the power of a god succeeded,

00:07:35.990 --> 00:07:38.630
but we were unable to maintain it,
 and it disappeared.

00:07:39.070 --> 00:07:44.690
<i>Those things Finé left, 
the Symphogears, are truly accursed.</i>

00:07:44.690 --> 00:07:47.240
A strike that can overcome 
an irreversible invincibility

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.190
that rises to the level of pseudo-godhood...

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:53.030
We need to devote time to 
understanding its mechanism.

00:07:53.030 --> 00:07:56.080
<i>We don't need to find the reason.</i>

00:07:56.080 --> 00:08:00.170
<i>We simply need to destroy
 the Symphogears.</i>

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:02.370
Understood.

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:06.940
Cagliostro and Prelati have gone ahead and 
are working on a mission to destroy them.

00:08:06.940 --> 00:08:09.290
I shall join them immediately.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:15.250
<i>The plane will be landing shortly.</i>

00:08:15.250 --> 00:08:18.410
<i>Please fasten your seatbelts—</i>

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.350
What?

00:08:22.260 --> 00:08:23.800
Alca-Noise?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:28.670
Clean hit!

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:32.240
Now, let's launch the second and third attacks!

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:36.600
The bigger the fireworks to welcome 
them, the happier they'll be!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.870
They attacked just as we're landing,
 when we're most vulnerable.

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:46.090
They followed us to Japan?

00:08:50.070 --> 00:08:51.140
The case!

00:08:55.560 --> 00:09:02.990
<i>Imyuteus Ame no Habakiri tron.</i>

00:09:36.290 --> 00:09:37.580
Tsubasa!

00:09:39.630 --> 00:09:42.560
<i>A blue flash roars</i>

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:45.740
<i>like a terrifying tiger</i>

00:09:45.020 --> 00:09:46.770
<b>Blue Flash</b>

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:48.900
<i>Pass this way to hell</i>

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:54.270
<i>As I count your sins one by one</i>

00:09:54.610 --> 00:09:57.800
Special Flight 206 has stopped responding!

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:57.960
<i>Oh, a hundred dazzling flowers</i>

00:09:57.800 --> 00:10:00.260
Tsubasa-san and Maria-san have escaped.

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:01.040
<i>A gift of bloody cherry blossoms</i>

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:01.040
But...

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:04.320
They're about to crash into the sea!

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:09.280
<i>Oh, chaos on the battlefield, 
a blade about to be unsheathed</i>

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:08.990
Tsubasa! Catch Maria-kun and 
prepare for impact on the water!

00:10:09.280 --> 00:10:12.910
<i>Once again tonight...</i>

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:11.100
I won't let you!

00:10:11.100 --> 00:10:12.910
Time for more!

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:14.950
<i>Here come the wings</i>

00:10:14.950 --> 00:10:18.910
<i>Even the gods may not be unjust</i>

00:10:18.910 --> 00:10:23.620
<i>If I see the Buddha I shall slay him</i>

00:10:21.520 --> 00:10:22.510
Maria-san!

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:24.260
Accelerate past them!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.710
<i>I'll slit his throat</i>

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:28.180
<i>No one will help you to your death</i>

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:31.700
<i>I'll never be beaten by scum</i>

00:10:31.700 --> 00:10:43.960
<i>May your blood rust on 
the blade of my resolve!</i>

00:10:35.940 --> 00:10:37.860
<b>Thousand Falling Tears</b>

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:56.030
They're pretty tough.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:11:00.000
I hate to say it, but we'll have to pick 
this up when Saint Germain gets here.

00:11:02.210 --> 00:11:04.890
We got a warm welcome, huh?

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:09.070
Were they after us Wielders?

00:11:10.030 --> 00:11:11.090
Or...

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:15.890
Senpai!

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:16.840
Tsubasa-san!

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:17.520
Maria!

00:11:18.470 --> 00:11:20.990
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:11:21.980 --> 00:11:24.180
You don't have to make 
such a big deal out of it.

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:28.280
The documents the Valverde government 
had saved are right here.

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:31.290
That's not it! You were 
attacked by the enemy, right?

00:11:31.570 --> 00:11:33.630
I'm so glad you're safe...

00:11:35.410 --> 00:11:38.040
Sorry for making you worry 
just after our return.

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:39.750
Thanks for caring.

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:43.410
But this is no time to relax.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:44.970
Look at this.

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.020
What's this?

00:11:48.360 --> 00:11:53.930
This is footage of a doll we took from
 the Valverde government's facility.

00:11:53.930 --> 00:11:56.150
Really? An Autoscorer?

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:05.300
In the last great war, 
Germany gathered many relics

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:08.060
to use as a replacement for fossil fuels.

00:12:08.060 --> 00:12:14.120
Several of them were brought to 
its ally, Japan, for research, but...

00:12:14.510 --> 00:12:17.090
My Gungnir?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:22.050
And the Nehushtan Armor, 
and Yukine's Ichaival, too...

00:12:22.050 --> 00:12:25.220
It's said that when high-ranking 
German officials fled

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:28.830
to South America after the war, 
many relics went with them.

00:12:28.830 --> 00:12:34.920
We can assume that's how this doll 
found its way to Valverde, too.

00:12:35.800 --> 00:12:38.780
Our only way to get answers

00:12:38.780 --> 00:12:43.070
is to look at these secret documents 
the Valverde government possessed.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.460
From the attack on Tsubasa and Maria-kun,

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:51.340
it's clear that the Bavarian Illuminati 
has made their way to Japan.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:54.260
Stay sharp.

00:12:58.990 --> 00:13:01.330
Miku! Sorry I'm late!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:03.500
Were the two of them okay?

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.440
Yeah! I was so happy to see that they were safe!

00:13:06.950 --> 00:13:08.430
<i>Now, our next story.</i>

00:13:08.430 --> 00:13:13.030
<i>Today it was revealed that the people 
aboard the craft that crash-landed</i>

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:17.590
<i>in American territorial waters were seeking 
asylum from the nation of Valverde.</i>

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:22.270
So, tell me more about what 
you said this morning.

00:13:22.270 --> 00:13:26.160
Yeah. I told you what happened in Valverde.

00:13:26.420 --> 00:13:29.950
Chris-chan's been down ever since then.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.160
I want to cheer her up, but...

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:34.130
Nobody asked you!

00:13:34.620 --> 00:13:37.320
You don't have to be like that, Yukine.

00:13:37.320 --> 00:13:39.260
They're both worried about you.

00:13:40.070 --> 00:13:41.720
Tsubasa-san's here, too!

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:46.080
It's not just us. 
Everybody's worried about you, Yukine.

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:50.190
I know that! 
But leave me alone! I'm fine.

00:13:50.500 --> 00:13:52.940
It was the only thing I could do for Stephan.

00:13:52.940 --> 00:13:57.050
If I found myself in the same situation,
I'd do the same thing every time.

00:13:58.160 --> 00:14:02.020
So that's your choice of justice.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:03.070
Yeah.

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:06.290
Choice of justice?

00:14:07.270 --> 00:14:12.190
Hey, I heard you haven't submitted 
your summer homework yet!

00:14:12.740 --> 00:14:16.110
That's right! What do I do, Miku?

00:14:16.110 --> 00:14:17.820
You'll just have to do the work.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.870
You need to finish it by your birthday.

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:22.340
Is Tachibana's birthday soon?

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.590
Yes. It's the 13th.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:27.890
That's less than two weeks.

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:30.300
You'll be spending your birthday 
doing homework, at this—

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:34.440
Yes? This is Hibiki.

00:14:34.700 --> 00:14:36.230
Alca-Noise have appeared!

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:39.580
They're in Sector 19, Northwest Point A!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:42.240
It should be near your location! Hurry!

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:57.980
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:28.150
<i>It's time to fly! (Let's fly!)</i>

00:15:28.150 --> 00:15:29.780
<i>It's time to journey into the sky! 
(Let's fly!)</i>

00:15:29.780 --> 00:15:31.020
<i>To tomorrow!</i>

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:36.480
<i>Bring our voices together as one 
in the greatest symphony of all</i>

00:15:36.480 --> 00:15:38.930
<i>Do you have a dream 
(Let's fight!) in your heart</i>

00:15:38.930 --> 00:15:41.940
<i>Do you have (Let's fight!) 
a passionate song</i>

00:15:41.940 --> 00:15:48.240
<i>Your overflowing heat explodes</i>

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:53.780
<i>An infinite soul connecting hand in hand</i>

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:51.550
She's finally here.

00:15:51.550 --> 00:15:52.680
How's it going?

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.930
We've just lured them out.

00:15:53.780 --> 00:15:58.190
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:15:55.790 --> 00:15:59.750
It's time to use that new
 specialized-function type.

00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:05.890
Let's see what your power is!

00:16:10.080 --> 00:16:11.820
More Alca-Noise?

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.200
Looks like there's more of them.

00:16:14.530 --> 00:16:16.440
A large Alca-Noise has been sighted!

00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:17.810
They disappeared?

00:16:18.180 --> 00:16:20.470
We can't get video of the Wielders!

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:23.590
We can just barely get audio 
from the gears' microphones!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:27.590
An Alca-Noise that closes off space?

00:16:31.100 --> 00:16:33.530
We were just in the middle of town!

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:44.980
Impossible!

00:16:45.720 --> 00:16:46.980
Our attacks...

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.650
...aren't working at all?

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:53.400
Is that Anti-LiNKER? But how?

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:57.660
No, the Wielders' compatibility 
coefficients haven't changed!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.130
So they haven't weakened our attacks,

00:17:01.130 --> 00:17:03.400
they've strengthened their defenses?

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:05.520
<i>Can you three hear me?</i>

00:17:05.520 --> 00:17:07.660
What the hell is going on here?

00:17:07.940 --> 00:17:12.660
We can assume you're in a subspace 
cage created by an Alca-Noise!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:15.420
Subspace cage?

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:20.070
The Alca-Noises' phase differential 
barriers are rapidly changing,

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:22.940
blocking the tuning caused by your impacts!

00:17:23.190 --> 00:17:26.680
That's why it seems that your 
gears are less powerful!

00:17:27.630 --> 00:17:31.360
Then, if we can amp up our power...

00:17:31.360 --> 00:17:33.940
Time to draw the cursed sword!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.450
Ignite Module!

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.210
Draw swords!

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:07.450
<i>Pushing it into the red as I jam my fist in</i>

00:18:07.450 --> 00:18:13.310
<i>The pure blade of a protector</i>

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:13.320
<b>Fearless Three Blades</b>

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:18.040
<i>The reason I feel so safe close to danger</i>

00:18:18.040 --> 00:18:24.870
<i>is that I can feel you watching my back</i>

00:18:24.870 --> 00:18:30.580
<i>So that I won't feel regrets for 
today, which will never come again</i>

00:18:24.940 --> 00:18:28.440
<i>With Ignite Mode, we can
 break through their defenses.</i>

00:18:28.760 --> 00:18:29.750
<i>But...</i>

00:18:30.570 --> 00:18:33.090
Is there no end to them?

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:35.960
<i>I'll turn even the darkness 
into the power of my heart</i>

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:38.450
With your swords drawn, your gears 
will shut down once you run out of time!

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:40.500
<i>I'll even clutch tight this 
pain which bites down on me</i>

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:39.330
Keep going!

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:41.700
It's so frustrating to be
 unable to do anything...

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:43.190
<i>A song from all (Let's fly!) my spirit</i>

00:18:42.180 --> 00:18:45.000
I don't want to just stand here and watch!

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:45.930
<i>Emotions from all (Let's fly!) my spirit</i>

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:48.560
It's because I keep having trouble 
researching the LiNKER...

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:51.120
<i>No matter how far apart we are, 
I swear to you I'll have courage</i>

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:50.230
But...

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:54.390
<i>Something... There must something we can do.</i>

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:54.110
<i>Once more (Let's fight!) the wind</i>

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:56.590
<i>Once more (Let's fight!) our resolve</i>

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:58.160
<i>Phase differential barriers. Subspace cages.</i>

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.970
<i>How many tears do you think we shed</i>

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:01.830
<i>And a new type of Alca-Noise that 
uses these things as powerful armor.</i>

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:02.490
<i>How much blood do you think we shed</i>

00:19:02.280 --> 00:19:06.100
<i>When the field appeared it took 
the form of a hemisphere...</i>

00:19:02.490 --> 00:19:08.030
<i>Until we made days that we could call love</i>

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:12.160
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:19:08.220 --> 00:19:12.160
Everyone, can you see the
 center of the space you're in?

00:19:12.480 --> 00:19:15.530
<i>We observed the space in 
the form of a hemisphere!</i>

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:19.850
<i>Which means it's likely the 
control system is in the center!</i>

00:19:22.810 --> 00:19:24.820
Chris-chan, you can't just fire randomly!

00:19:24.820 --> 00:19:29.520
I scattered speakers that 
link with our mic units!

00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:32.890
We can use our gears to pick up the echoes 
of our songs throughout this space!

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:35.290
I get it! If we can use that like sonar,

00:19:35.290 --> 00:19:38.650
to determine our positions 
and the layout of this space...

00:19:40.860 --> 00:19:45.720
<i>Even if I go down a million 
times, I'll still be just fine</i>

00:19:45.720 --> 00:19:51.660
<i>I've got a reason to rise up 
and leap off the ground</i>

00:19:51.660 --> 00:19:56.420
<i>Offering my songs to a 
million and one heavens</i>

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:57.920
There!

00:19:56.420 --> 00:20:02.880
<i>Sharing the answer that can only 
be found when you look ahead</i>

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:08.810
<i>The true enemy is always within your heart</i>

00:20:05.410 --> 00:20:08.800
That's the Alca-Noise that's 
creating this space!

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.490
That's it! Destroy it!

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:14.150
<i>Reflecting on the meaning of having weapons</i>

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:13.170
Tachibana, get on!

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:14.140
Right!

00:20:14.150 --> 00:20:18.240
<i>Strike with extra-large passion!</i>

00:20:18.530 --> 00:20:21.330
<i>Unleash your (Let's fly!) life</i>

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:24.170
<i>To its very (Let's fly!) limits</i>

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:26.180
We'll bet everything on this next strike!

00:20:24.170 --> 00:20:27.050
<i>An unstoppable resonance</i>

00:20:27.050 --> 00:20:29.280
<i>Telling you to change the world</i>

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:31.950
<i>The hope I want (Let's fly!) to embrace</i>

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:34.950
<i>The light I want (Let's fly!) to embrace</i>

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:38.080
<i>I know rests within</i>

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.760
<i>arms held outstretched</i>

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.480
<i>I'll never give up, I'll never run away</i>

00:20:43.480 --> 00:20:46.140
<i>Let my sound resonate</i>

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:49.760
<i>Passionate Chorus Infinity</i>

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:03.940
Seems like it worked.

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:12.060
Maria-san!

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:18.380
You gave me a heart that never gives up, 
and it's still within me!

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:22.080
So I'm sure I'll finish the LiNKER!

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:24.670
I'll be waiting.

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:34.110
Well, I was hoping that would 
work, but no dice, I guess.

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:37.140
Still, we fulfilled our goal.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:41.400
Is it okay to be so relaxed?

00:21:41.400 --> 00:21:44.390
Tiki, I told you to stay at the base.

00:21:44.670 --> 00:21:48.620
But I thought I could 
see Adam if I came here!

00:21:48.620 --> 00:21:51.380
Don't get mad, though! 
I found out something great!

00:21:51.380 --> 00:21:52.370
What?

00:21:52.640 --> 00:21:53.590
Get this!

00:21:54.050 --> 00:21:59.540
This looks like a great place 
for us to pick a fight with God!

00:22:00.360 --> 00:22:02.930
The best place possible, actually!
